  "description": "The Light.PortableResults.AspNetCore.Shared package contains shared functionality for writing ASP.NET Core HTTP responses. Compatible with Native AOT. Check out the integration packages Light.PortableResults.AspNetCore.MinimalApis or Light.PortableResults.AspNetCore.Mvc.",
